 "section_summary": "This section comprises pages 32 through 88 of a comprehensive roster of Japanese educational institutions located in Aichi Prefecture. The document provides detailed statistical tables for municipal, town, and village schools, including youth schools (Seinen Gakko), elementary schools (Sho Gakko), kindergartens (Yochien), and vocational schools (Jitsugyo Gakko). Each entry records the institution's name, address, founding date, male and female student enrollment, and full-time and part-time faculty counts as of April 30, 1946, and November 30, 1946.",
